# I-ADOPT decomposition for the NorESM2 Arctic radioisotope dataset.
# Concept URIs taken verbatim from Barbara Magagna's definitions in
# mabablue/I-ADOPT-Variables: CCA/U236LH.ttl, CCA/SSW.ttl, Ocean/SST.ttl.
#
# schema:name / schema:url accompany the iop: structure because the FAIR2Adapt
# dashboard resolves those two predicates when rendering each component.

<http://vocabs.lter-europe.net/EnvThes/22225> a iop:Entity ; rdfs:label "water" ; schema:name "water" ; schema:url <http://vocabs.lter-europe.net/EnvThes/22225> .
